    <string name="consent_title">Turn on message guard?</string>
    <string name="consent_body">Saqr reads new notifications from these apps only: Messages (Google, Samsung), Gmail, Outlook, WhatsApp, WhatsApp Business and Telegram.\n\nThe check starts on your phone. Only a message with a link, a phone number with a claim (fine, bank, prize…), or a request for a code, PIN or card details is sent to the Saqr server. Codes in it are hidden first. The sender is sent only when it is a phone number or a business sender name. Ordinary chats never leave your phone.\n\nThis phone keeps your last 50 alerts (web address, result, reasons), never the message text or the sender. The server keeps flagged results for 30 days.\n\nTurn it off any time here, or in Settings > Notification access.</string>
    <string name="consent_accept">I agree, continue</string>
    <string name="consent_decline">Not now</string>
